      "writtenOn": "2019-10-09T18:19:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Correct, that code is also incorrect since ImsPhone does not implement dialInternal(...). EVENT_INITIATE_SILENT_REDIAL should be registered to the GsmCdmaPhone, since we are doing a IMS-\u003eCS redial.\n\nMy recommendation is to remove the registerForSilentRedial method call in Phone.java and instead register the event in GsmCdmaPhone\u0027s init function.",
