      "writtenOn": "2019-10-10T16:35:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Phone is also a parent of ImsPhone. dialInternal(...) is only implemented in GsmCdmaPhone, not ImsPhone.\n\nEVENT_INITIATE_SILENT_REDIAL is registered on ImsPhone in Phone#updateImsPhone, so when the ImsPhone receives the event EVENT_INITIATE_SILENT_REDIAL (and processes it through its parent Phone), it will call dialInternal, which will return null, since there is no implementation in ImsPhone.",
      "parentUuid": "dbbdb5ff_7d583f5e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 724,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 724,
        "endChar": 37
      },
      "revId": "8548e0a57db13c75fb4609f8b34f5177465ff122",
