      "side": 1,
      "message": "As i know, GsmCdmaPhone receives the event EVENT_INITIATE_SILENT_REDIAL(through its parent Phone), so dialInternal() in GsmCdmaPhone is called. Isn\u0027t it?",
      "parentUuid": "20773957_c37bafcb",
      "range": {
