      "writtenOn": "2019-10-14T18:13:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My apologies, you are correct, the register is indeed called from GsmCdmaPhone. This registers the event ImsPhone#registerForSilentRedial on the GsmCdmaPhone, so dialInternal() will be called correctly.\n\n--\n\nThe issue still remains that notifyRedialConnectionChanged should be called on the Phone object directly. In TelephonyConnection, Phone#registerForRedialConnectionChanged is being called on the GsmCdmaPhone, not the ImsPhone, so we need to also make sure that notifyRedialConnectionChanged is called on GsmCdmaPhone, not ImsPhone",
      "parentUuid": "1077ad4e_d398d662",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 724,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 724,
        "endChar": 37
